          "entradaId": "freeman-780",
          "modulo": "freeman-manners-customs"
        },
        "texto": "This was considered one of the most degrading employments, not only by the Jews, but by other nations. Among the Egyptians, for example, the swineherd was completely shut out from society. The Saviour makes use of this antipathy to illustrate the depth of misery to which the diss…"
      }
